-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MeoNS5rKNiEQ7kNvwGPTN0T&_nc_oc=AdogGTc-P-LxvJ_sEEPFWmRk8JyTHpA5HhHs9ShCq-shj1MA2iPKNMk_6Otv0hAZ6qs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRohH0i7SSNIxo0L7ILtl4mxf7x4R3wq_hBeaqBOor8iw&oe=6B006A88"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics", "keywords": ["NCSG", "Chimney", "Sweep", "Training", "Gas"], "long_description": "\n\n**Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics** trains users on core skills required to safely understand, inspect, and diagnose common gas fireplace systems encountered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools.\n\n**Gas System Fundamentals** \u2013 Learn how common gas fireplace systems are designed, including millivolt and electronic ignition configurations.\n\n**Component Identification**\u2013 Identify key gas components such as valves, pilots, thermocouples, thermopiles, stepper motors, limit switches, and shutoff devices.\n\n**Electrical Testing Procedures** \u2013 Practice safe multimeter use for voltage, resistance, and continuity testing across gas system components.\n\n**Operational Understanding** \u2013 Observe how gas systems operate during startup, normal operation, and shutdown, and how failures affect performance.", "short_description": "**Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics** trains users on core skills required to safely understand, inspect, and diagnose common gas fireplace systems encountered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools."}]}, "develope